# Implementation Plan: Comments and Profile Pages

This plan outlines the steps required to implement a comments system and a user profile page for the hackblog application.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This plan assumes the use of the existing Drizzle ORM and Express backend.
> The frontend will continue to use React with Vite and Tailwind CSS (or standard CSS as per current project style).

## Proposed Changes

### Backend

#### [MODIFY] [schema.js](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/backend/lib/db/schema.js)
- Define a new `comments` table with fields: `id`, `content`, `authorId`, `postId`, `createdAt`.
- Update relations to include comments for both authors and posts.

#### [NEW] [comments.js](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/backend/routes/comments.js)
- Implement `getPostComments`: Fetch all comments for a specific post.
- Implement `createComment`: Allow authenticated users to post comments.
- Implement `getUserComments`: Fetch all comments by a specific user.

#### [NEW] [user.js](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/backend/routes/user.js)
- Implement `getUserProfile`: Fetch user details along with their activity (posts and comments).

#### [MODIFY] [server.js](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/backend/server.js)
- Register new routes for comments and user profiles.

---

### Frontend

#### [MODIFY] [api.js](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/frontend/src/services/api.js)
- Add methods to [api.js](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/frontend/src/services/api.js) for:
    - `commentsAPI.getByPost(postId)`
    - `commentsAPI.create({ postId, content })`
    - `userAPI.getProfile(userId)`

#### [NEW] [CommentsPage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/frontend/src/pages/CommentsPage.jsx)
- A page to display comments for a specific story (likely linked from the "comments" link on the main page).
- Include a form for adding new comments if the user is authenticated.

#### [NEW] [ProfilePage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/frontend/src/pages/ProfilePage.jsx)
- A page to show user information (name, bio, joined date).
- List the user's recent posts and comments.

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/frontend/src/App.jsx)
- Add routes for `/comments/:postId` and `/profile/:userId`.

#### [MODIFY] [mainPage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/samar/OneDrive/Desktop/family/hackblog/frontend/src/mainPage.jsx)
- Update "comments" links to point to the new `CommentsPage`.
- Update user links to point to the `ProfilePage`.

## Verification Plan

### Backend Verification
- Use `curl` or Postman to test new API endpoints:
    - `GET /api/comments/post/:postId`
    - `POST /api/comments` (with Auth header)
    - `GET /api/user/profile/:userId`

### Frontend Verification
- Manually navigate to the profile page from a user link.
- Navigate to the comments page from a story link.
- Attempt to post a comment while logged in and verify it appears.
- Verify the profile page correctly displays user-specific data.
